[{"id":185060625,"discussion_id":"667cec30fbba68a37b41100ce3618201274c50a7","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 主要针对 `A2avGmm` 调度流程，在 `mc2/all_to_allv_quant_grouped_mat_mul/op_kernel/mc2_templates/scheduler/a2av_gmm_scheduler.h` 中新增 AIC barrier 同步逻辑，用于在 shared expert 与 routed expert 之间建立跨核同步，确保计算在 AIC 上的执行顺序与数据一致性。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **增加 AIC 同步触发条件**: 在 `tilingData_->isNeedMM != 0` 时执行完 `localComputeOp.Process(0)` 后，通过 `ASCEND_IS_AIC` 条件判断进入新增的 AIC 同步逻辑。\n- **设置 AIC barrier 标志**: 新增 `AscendC::CrossCoreSetFlag<SYNC_MODE_AIC_BARRIER, PIPE_FIX>(SYNC_FLAG_ID_AIC_BARRIER)`，在 AIC 上设置 `SYNC_FLAG_ID_AIC_BARRIER` 对应的跨核同步标志。\n- **等待 AIC barrier 标志**: 新增 `AscendC::CrossCoreWaitFlag<SYNC_MODE_AIC_BARRIER, PIPE_S>(SYNC_FLAG_ID_AIC_BARRIER)`，等待相同标志完成，实现 shared expert 与 routed expert 之间的 AIC barrier 同步。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-17T10:46:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T10:48:23+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185060667,"discussion_id":"0845d7b033deea0f5b78c401a23204c819814630","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n libohao6, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-08-17T10:46:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T10:46:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185060669,"discussion_id":"45dc2160ded6bd8898057843954aafd8a393dfad","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**